    {
      "id": "claim_c8a810730aa944a1ad8d91a1b0c62fe6",
      "statement": "The database configuration from `Main.p` seeds two HikariCP data sources: `PSP_CONNECTOR_ONECOMM` from `database.*` properties and `PSP_CONNECTOR_ONECOMM_PAYMENT2` from the `database.payment2.*` properties, each with independent pool sizes and Oracle connection settings.",
