      "id": "claim_8bc42f9b61ba4fe39ac355340954c647",
      "statement": "Startup wires `Main.p` values into static handlers and server construction: ClientAuthorizationHandler gets service name/region/auth type/algorithm and the shared Properties object, the payment provider gets the verify-card merchant, and PSPConnectorServer receives worker/event-loop pool sizes, timeouts, and network binding values.",
