      "id": "claim_8276745ec1ad41b4a3ec2a4b552650a5",
      "statement": "OneComm response status codes are configured as `onecomm.status.N.code` and `onecomm.status.N.desc` pairs, and OnecommGateway maps transaction response codes to these names and descriptions at runtime, including bank-specific overrides via `onecomm.status.N.bank.M.*`.",
